1 NOTE {geni:about_me} VASENIUS Johan Valfrid, SKO/KO. * Helsinki 6.9.1885, vanht FT, ylim. prof. Gustaf Valfrid Vasenius ja Johanna Emilia Palmén. Yo Hgin suom. yhteisk. FK (hk) ja FM 1910. Viipurin kaupunginkirjaston johtaja. † Simola 
2 CONC (ilmahyökkäyksessä) 19.06.1944
2 CONT
2 CONT https://fi.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simolan_pommitus_1944
2 CONT
2 CONT When leaving Viborg during the Soviet attack Johan and his wife were on foot heading away fom the battle zone. Then a car stopped and it was said that there was room for one person. Johan told his wife to go and that was the last 
2 CONC time he was seen as shortly after that Soviet bombers came and started to drop bombs on the innocent civilians fleeing their burning city. In Lappeenranta there is a mass grave where the victims of this war crime are buried and th
2 CONC ere is a stone with Johan´s name on it. Nobody in the family knows if he really is buried there since there was no possibility to identify his body as he probably got a direct hit by a bomb.
2 CONT
2 CONT syntymä: Helsinki syntyneet 1885-1906 (MKO40-78)   ; SSHY http://www.sukuhistoria.fi/sshy/sivut/jasenille/paikat.php?bid=9390&pnum=62 / Viitattu 21.09.2022
