1 NOTE {geni:about_me} JOAN RUTH SIMONSON Funeral Services will be held at 4:00 PM on Friday, January 20, 2012 at the First Lutheran Church in Buhl with Judy Peliska officiating. Visitation will be for one hour prior to the service at th
2 CONC e church on Friday. Interment will be in Lakeview Cemetery in Buhl. Arrangements are entrusted to Rupp Funeral Home & Cremation Service of Chisholm. Memorials may be made to the First Lutheran Church of Buhl. Joan Ruth Simonson, a
2 CONC ge 83, of Buhl, died Tuesday, January 17, 2012 at Cornerstone Villa in Buhl. She was born October 1, 1928 in Chisholm to Axel and Elin (Lillvikar) Backman. Joan enjoyed her 12 grandchildren and 10 great-grandchildren. She also enj
2 CONC oyed cooking and picture puzzles. Joan is survived by her husband of 63 years – Francis; her brother – Thomas (Ina) Backman of Two Harbors, MN; children – Roger Simonson (Marianne Tymenski) of Holland, MI; Christine (John) Craft o
2 CONC f Berkley, MI; Elayne (Dale) Engdahl of Chisholm; Glenn Simonson of Dunnellon, FL; Gail (Jim) Lagges of Elk River, MN; Tim Simonson; Eric “Rick” Simonson (Tami Gruenhagen); and Terry Simonson all of Buhl. She was preceded in death
2 CONC  by her parents; by her son – Scott; and by 10 brothers and sisters. A special thank you to all the staff of Cornerstone Villa for the wonderful care and service for Joan.
