1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Gustaf Edvard Helenelund (6 June 1885, Solf - 13 March 1976) was a Swedish-speaking Finnish farmer and politician. He was a member of the Parliament of Finland from 1919 to 1924, from 1927 to 1929 and from 1930 to 
2 CONC 1945, representing the Swedish People's Party of Finland (SFP).[1] [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Edvard_Helenelund]<br/>
2 CONT [https://fi.wikipedia.org/wiki/Edvard_Helenelund]
2 CONT ----
