2 CONT "Find A Grave Index," database, FamilySearch (https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:QVVQ-PXQH : 20 May 2020), Anna Sofia Swarvar Berg, 1982; Burial, , ; citing record ID , Find a Grave, http://www.findagrave.com.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://sv.findagrave.com/memorial/6297050/anna-sofia-berg:
2 CONT Anna Sofia Swarvar Berg
2 CONT Födelse 27 Maj 1886  Tölby, Mustasaari Municipality, Ostrobothnia, Finland
2 CONT Död 8 Nov 1982 (ålder 96)  Muskegon, Muskegon County, Michigan, USA
2 CONT Begravning  Mona View Cemetery  Muskegon Heights, Muskegon County, Michigan, USA 
2 CONT Gravplats  166-A-11
2 CONT daughter of Ullrika Maria (Enegren) and Jonas Johan Erikson Tolix Swarvar born Aug.17,1843 in Korsholm, Finland and died Aug.22,1899. Anna came to U.S. in 1904. married on May 19, 1906 to Carl Fredrik Berg.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs. Berg, age 96, died Monday. The former Anna Swarvar was born in Vasa, Finland and was married to Carl F. Berg who preceded her in death in Oct 1946. She was a formed member of Samuel Lutheran Church. Survivors includes 8 sons'
2 CONC  Wilfrid, George, Norman, Harold, Arthur & Fred all of Muskegon, Leonard of Calif, & Jack of Tenn, 2 daughters, Mrs Thomas C.(Linnea) Jensen & Mrs. Roy E. (Dorothy) Smith both of Muskegon, 22 grandchildren,37 great-grandchildren, 
2 CONC 2 great-great grandchildren, and nieces and nephews in Finland and in USA, A son, Carl, proceded her in death in 1972. Service-Thursday at 1 p.m. at Clock Chapel with the Rev.Ronnie C. Peterson officiating. Interment Mona View Cem
2 CONC etery, Muskegon.
